      "text": "@hwchase17 @mgarimella underrated point. a goal you can give feedback on is also a goal the agent can check itself against mid-run. long-horizon agents rarely fail at step 1, they drift around step 40 because the goal was vibes. make it checkable and you get drift detection for free\n\n@sibyl_labs_",
      "url": "https://x.com/billionbuckbam/status/2121743029296156949"
