      "text": "@hwchase17 @mgarimella Matches what I see running 9 AI bots for a small business. One bot per job (lead hunting, pitches, posting) beats one bot per customer, because feedback on one batch fixes every future batch. Similar drafts are faster to review. Do motions share one feedback file?",
