      "note_tweet": {
        "text": "We solved this a long time ago with offensive hacking at the NSA.  There is so much planning that goes into an offensive op, that when AI came along it was super easy for me to adopt what I was already doing for cyber planning into agentic goal engineering.  \n\nAn objective, a target list, and a stop condition.\n\nAgents need all three, and the stop condition is the one people leave out (looking at your OpenAI / sandboxing failures)."
      },
