        "text": "@hwchase17 @mgarimella Yeah, the goal is only half of it. The other half is how you check it's done. Ours kept saying finished when the file wasn't even there, so now a script checks the actual result before anything counts. If the agent grades its own goal, it'll pass itself every time."
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1471329673720176654",
        "conversation_id": "2121714279103578416",
